This folder is where the nine recorded voice notes go — one per storm and one
per emergency — under exactly these names:

    the storm door      covid  gfc  corr2022  drawn
    the emergency door  icu  business  pandemic  war  jobloss

The simulator asks for "<name>.m4a" first and "<name>.ogg" second.

Until a file exists here, the device voice reads the English captions on the
same clock, which is the designed fallback. Dropping a recording in needs no
code change and no rebuild.

This marker file exists only so the folder itself is kept: git cannot store an
empty directory.
